### 1. Registrar un Voluntario de prueba
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "voluntario.carlos@rescate.org",
  "password": "carlosPass123",
  "nombre": "Carlos Gómez",
  "telefono": "+5493512345678",
  "rol": "VOLUNTARIO"
}

### 2. Login del Voluntario (para obtener su token)
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "voluntario.carlos@rescate.org",
  "password": "carlosPass123"
}

